:: Ethan Desk Visit [micro_event event nobr] {"position":"1800,3025","size":"100,100"}
/* Desk visitor (micro event 22, "Desk visitors" in Define Events): he comes by to show off something useless he built.
   Shown in the CMD drawer, so no action is spent and there is no exit link. Small company effects only. */
<p>$ethan.name sets his laptop down on the corner of my desk and turns it toward me, very carefully, like it's a cake he baked himself.</p>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs to [
	{ who: $ethan, text: "Okay, boss. You're going to love this, and then you're going to tell me to delete it, and I want you to know I'll respect that. Eventually." },
	{ who: $player, text: "What did you do?" },
	{ who: $ethan, text: either("I hooked the build server up to the office speaker, so every time one of $brian.name's tests fails, it plays a sad trombone. It's played eleven times today, and he's started apologizing to it.", "I wrote a bot that guesses everyone's lunch order. It's right about seventy percent of the time, and a hundred percent of the time with $darius.name, because he's eaten the same salad every day since he started.", "I found out the coffee machine has an API. Don't ask me why a coffee machine has an API. It now posts in the team chat every time somebody takes the last cup and doesn't make a new pot, and so far it's mostly posted about me.") },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>
<div id="ethan-desk-choice" class="choices">
	<div>
		<<link "Let him show you">>
			<<replace "#ethan-desk-choice">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ text: "He runs me through the whole thing, including a demo he has very obviously rehearsed. Halfway through I catch myself laughing, and he points at me like he's just won a bet with himself." },
					{ who: $ethan, text: "See? That's morale. I'm basically HR now." },
					{ who: $player, text: "You're definitely not HR." },
					{ who: $ethan, text: "Fine, I'm the fun part of HR. The part that brings snacks." },
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<p>Behind him, somebody at the other desks laughs at something on their screen, and it's the loose, easy kind of laugh I don't hear in here that often.</p>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "Morale" 2>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Ask about the actual work">>
			<<replace "#ethan-desk-choice">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "Great. And the thing I'm actually paying you for?" },
					{ who: $ethan, text: "Wow, okay, straight for the throat." },
					{ text: "He closes the laptop, but he's still grinning, and then he gives me a proper rundown: what's done, what's stuck, and what's stuck because $brian.name and he can't agree on a variable name. It's a better report than I'd have got from him in a meeting." },
					{ who: $ethan, text: "I'll have the stuck part unstuck by tomorrow. The variable name thing might need a mediator." },
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "Efficiency" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
</div>
